WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:03.230
I had a chance to see the world today.

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:06.610
I saw that my road
ahead was still far and harsh.

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:07.530
But...

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:11.120
I don't want to stop!

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:15.950
I love the pro wrestling
that made me who I am today!

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:17.580
I...

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:22.460
I... wanna be the strongest in the world!

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.010
Wow... That was extreme!

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:31.600
Pro wrestling is so exciting!

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:36.140
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:39.310
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:47.940
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:00:55.950 --> 00:01:01.210
<i>The feelings after frustration</i>

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:06.710
<i>Are beyond my every choice</i>

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:12.340
<i>Resolve myself to not accept losing</i>

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:17.390
<i>Then stand up onto a new stage</i>

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:22.940
<i>White, glistening sweat is beautiful</i>

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:28.320
<i>I decided I'll live my life</i>

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:31.200
<i>No matter how many times I fall</i>

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:37.870
<i>If I stand up the same,</i>
<i>it will lead me to tomorrow</i>

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:40.580
<i>With a strong feeling to not lose</i>

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:43.790
<i>Say goodbye to the previous me</i>

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:48.880
<i>A different me from yesterday is being born</i>

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:51.720
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:01:51.930 --> 00:01:54.800
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:01:55.010 --> 00:02:02.310
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:08.520
Episode 09: The Amazing Newcomer!

00:02:07.870 --> 00:02:10.670
So this is Berserk...!

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:13.880
I can't wait!

00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:21.180
Whoa! Sweet!

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:24.810
Super!

00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:26.390
Amazing!

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:28.770
Awesome!

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:31.650
Ooh!

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:36.570
It's the ring! Ring!

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:40.780
Wow! It's a lot higher than I thought!

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:42.160
H-Hey you...!

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:43.870
The hell are you doing?!

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:46.910
Oof!

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:51.210
Owww... Don't surprise me like that.

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:52.840
Hey!

00:02:54.090 --> 00:02:55.380
R-Rio-<i>san...</i>

00:02:55.590 --> 00:03:00.050
A ring isn't a place for brats
like you to be fooling around in!

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:01.760
Awww...

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:04.430
But no one's using it, so isn't it, like, okay?

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:07.810
That's not the point!
Are you deaf or something?!

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:12.310
Nopey! I wanna go there!
On the ring! Like, now! Pronto!

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:14.150
Augh, just shut up!

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:17.530
Shut it when I'm yelling at ya, brat!

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:21.360
Stop calling me a brat!

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:24.200
Well, I am small, but I'm not a brat!

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:27.620
Oh really? Then prove it.

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:32.000
If you beat me, you're
free to use anything you want.

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:33.630
Rio-<i>san</i>!

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:36.760
You're going to...
keep your promise, right?

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:38.880
Only if you beat me.

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:40.680
Well, not like a runt like...

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:42.300
Huh?!

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:47.640
Ha!

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:50.230
Rio-<i>san</i>?!

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:52.980
A kick...? Was that a kick?

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:55.270
I didn't see a thing...

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:58.690
Um, uh, what's the matter?

00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:00.570
What's with the scary faces?

00:04:00.780 --> 00:04:04.280
Are you a challenger
from another wrestling group?

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:07.040
Came alone, eh...?

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:09.540
Berserk is sure being underestimated...

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:13.120
Ah... I don't like the looks of this...

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:16.090
Whoa, hey, what's the commotion?

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:17.880
Hey! Uncle Inoba!

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:19.090
Huh?

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:21.470
Uncle... Inoba?

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:24.930
Aw shoot! You've done it again...

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:29.680
Moe-<i>chan</i>, still resolving
things with your fists, are you?

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:32.560
Heh, well, I used a kick today...

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:35.020
President Inoba... Who is this kid?

00:04:35.230 --> 00:04:36.650
Huh?

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:39.480
It's Sakura-<i>sempai</i>! Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:41.610
S-Sakura-<i>sempai</i>?!

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:42.530
Huh?

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:43.490
What?

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:44.490
Huh?

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:46.120
Wait...!

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:50.870
Sakura-<i>sempai</i> and
Jackall-<i>san</i>'s special match

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:52.540
like, totally moved me!

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:56.630
Sakura-<i>sempai</i>'s "I wanna be
the strongest in the world," was like,

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:59.340
so super that Moe
decided to be a pro wrestler!

00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:00.960
Oh, um, okay...

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:05.590
Well, I didn't like the
Sweet Diva Sakura-<i>sempai...</i>

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:09.430
But, but! I love the
pro wrestler Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:11.140
You're Moe's idol!

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:15.440
All right, but...
do you mind getting off me?

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:17.060
Huh?

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:19.860
Hi there everyone!

00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:21.780
The name's Fukuoka Moe!

00:05:21.990 --> 00:05:23.320
I'm a freshman in high school!

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:26.820
Moe-<i>chan</i> is the grandchild of my mentor

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:29.660
from back in the days
when I was still wrestling.

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:31.950
That's why I've known her for a while.

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:35.580
Yes! Uncle played with
me a lot from when I was a kid.

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:40.380
She may be on the small side,
but don't underestimate her.

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:43.420
After all, she is the Bugen-style karate

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:46.970
high school world champion.

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:48.430
The world champion?

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:51.390
That explains that kick earlier.

00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:55.730
I was personally intrigued
at Moe-<i>chan</i>'s fighting skills

00:05:55.940 --> 00:05:58.690
so I offered her a
chance to be a wrestler

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:00.860
but she kept refusing my offer.

00:06:01.070 --> 00:06:03.650
I pretty much gave up, but...

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:07.490
I wanna be a pro wrestler,
just like Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:08.490
What?

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:10.200
Like Sakura-<i>sempai</i> said,

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:12.490
Moe wants to be the
strongest in the world too!

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:15.250
Please take me in as your pupil! Please!

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:16.870
P-Pupil?!

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:19.500
Wait! I'm still learning here too!

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:21.590
I'm in no position to teach you...

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:26.420
Oh, no! There's no other
teacher to me than Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:28.300
Well, there you have it.

00:06:28.510 --> 00:06:32.470
Take good care of Moe-<i>chan</i>, Hagiwara.

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:34.680
P-Pres...!

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:49.610
O-Owww...!

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:51.780
This pull here's really painful.

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:55.500
I wasn't able to handle this at first either...

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:02.750
G-Give...

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:08.090
That's right. Anyone
would give up to get out of this.

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:11.340
I'll tell her that "There's
no such thing as giving up!"

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:14.890
and teach Moe-<i>chan</i> the
seriousness of pro wrestling!

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:18.350
There's no such thing as
giving up, right?! Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:20.560
Huh? Um, yeah...

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:22.900
Moe's gonna do her best!

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:28.110
Did I hold back too
much here? Well then...!

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:34.870
Owww...!

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:38.250
Ouch...!

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:41.540
I won't let you!

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:45.630
Now, just a little more...

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:48.590
The moment Moe-<i>chan</i> grabs the rope

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:51.630
I'll finish this with,
"This is pro wrestling!"

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:57.720
Now do you know?! This...

00:07:57.930 --> 00:08:00.940
This is pro wrestling!
Right, Sakura-<i>sempai</i>?!

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:03.350
Huh? Um, yes...

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:08.490
So this is the nature of pro
wrestling that Grandpa told me about!

00:08:08.690 --> 00:08:11.780
Sakura-<i>sempai</i>! Pro wrestling is so fun!

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:14.120
Um, sure...

00:08:30.590 --> 00:08:32.430
The Juri Crash?!

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:47.480
It's the Spider Hold!

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:54.490
G-Give up...!

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:01.540
Such a worthy display by Miyabi's
top wrestler and representative

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:03.080
Sanada Juri.

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:04.540
Jackall-<i>san</i>!

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:09.630
The Juri Crash to Spider
Hold transition was perfect.

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:11.670
What brought you here today?

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:16.090
Oh? Was it a bother for me
to come and see my cute junior?

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:17.930
N-No, not at all...

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:22.600
I came here today to ask you something.

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:28.730
Juri, how long has it
been since you left Shangri-La

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:32.740
and started up Miyabi here in Japan?

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:35.200
It's been just about a year.

00:09:35.410 --> 00:09:37.200
That's some work you did.

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:40.830
I heard Miyabi is as
prominent as Berserk now.

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:43.500
Please... We're still far from it.

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:46.290
So then, with all you've accomplished

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:51.300
why did you mask
yourself and ruin the matches?

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:05.730
You're the Blue Panther, aren't you, Juri?

00:10:08.230 --> 00:10:10.440
As sharp as usual.

00:10:10.650 --> 00:10:14.440
I changed my fighting
style to hide my identity, but

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:18.410
I guess there's no
hiding from you, Jackall-<i>san.</i>

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:24.450
As you suspect, I'm the Blue Panther.

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:28.960
So why did you do that?
What are you trying to accomplish?

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:31.040
Accomplish...

00:10:31.880 --> 00:10:33.880
I'm after Hagiwara Sakura.

00:10:34.090 --> 00:10:35.510
Sakura?

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:45.770
Whoopsie! Sorry I'm late!

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:47.560
Augh! Shut up!

00:10:47.770 --> 00:10:51.820
Can't you just get in
here quietly or something?!

00:10:52.610 --> 00:10:56.400
What? Were you detained
for sleeping in class again?

00:10:56.610 --> 00:10:59.700
Of course not! I was
the class helper today!

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:01.620
The class helper...?

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:03.700
The nostalgia...

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:07.790
Hearing that is so like being in high school.

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:10.290
"High school wrestler, Fukuoka Moe!"

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:12.210
Wow, I can already
see her being a major hit.

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:14.420
The heck are you yapping?

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:17.220
Karate champ or not,

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:20.260
you've only been here
for a month, so stop slacking!

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:24.180
Hold your smile until
you go pro, high school girlie!

00:11:24.390 --> 00:11:25.600
Well of course!

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:28.770
I'm gonna be a pro wrestler in a flash!

00:11:33.230 --> 00:11:35.320
Beating around the bush as usual.

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:37.490
Can you believe that
was supposed to be a rally?

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:39.570
Well, that is Rio-<i>san</i>, you know?

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:41.620
Huh? Did you say something?

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:44.410
Nope. Nothing at all.

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:45.370
Huh?

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:48.790
Moe-<i>chan</i>, hurry. Everyone's waiting.

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:50.830
Huh? Everyone?

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:55.750
Right. Everyone gathered
together for you today.

00:12:00.430 --> 00:12:02.340
Good, twenty-eight!

00:12:02.550 --> 00:12:06.850
I guess this test was too
harsh for a one month rookie...

00:12:07.060 --> 00:12:10.350
Does it worry you as
guardian to your mentor's niece?

00:12:10.560 --> 00:12:13.020
No. I've got no intention of
giving her any special treatment.

00:12:13.230 --> 00:12:16.940
I can't guarantee she'll make it,
but I have expectations of her.

00:12:17.150 --> 00:12:18.940
Twenty-nine!

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:22.110
Her knack for fighting is quite impressive.

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:24.120
To add, she's got a strong will.

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:27.370
I believe she'll go leaps and bounds

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:30.210
the more she's pitted to pressure.

00:12:35.090 --> 00:12:36.000
Thirty!

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:37.960
All right, change!

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:43.220
I'm next. Are you ready?

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:46.100
P-Please, I'm ready.

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:51.730
Thirty-one!

00:12:56.860 --> 00:12:58.280
Thirty-two!

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:01.700
Thirty-three!

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:05.870
It's so intense! It's not like karate at all!

00:13:06.070 --> 00:13:09.540
Did they all go through
this to become a pro?!

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:13.830
But... Sakura-<i>sempai</i> is looking on...

00:13:14.790 --> 00:13:17.500
I can't be giving up now!

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:29.350
All right, ninety!

00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:36.150
Ten more left, Moe-<i>chan</i>!

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:38.230
Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:40.480
Let's get through this together!

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:43.320
Yes!

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:45.610
Yeah, do it!

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:48.660
Last ten! Show your stuff!

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:58.130
Ninety-one!

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:01.500
Ninety-two!

00:14:01.710 --> 00:14:03.130
Ninety-three!

00:14:05.180 --> 00:14:06.970
Ninety-four!

00:14:11.350 --> 00:14:12.770
Huh?!

00:14:15.810 --> 00:14:17.690
Ninety-nine!

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:24.400
Just... one more...

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:28.160
I'll endure this...

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:30.280
I'll become a pro...

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:34.080
I'm gonna be with Sakura-<i>sempai</i>, and...!

00:14:34.290 --> 00:14:36.370
Last one, Moe-<i>chan</i>!

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:44.380
One hundred!

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:08.820
Good!

00:15:09.030 --> 00:15:10.280
Congratulations, Moe-<i>chan</i>!

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:11.450
- Awesome!
- You passed!

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:13.410
You're ready for your pro debut!

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:15.040
Huh?!

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:22.960
Yahoo...!

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:25.260
Wha...?! Whoa, whoa, whoa...

00:15:26.760 --> 00:15:28.220
Moe-<i>chan</i>?!

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:32.220
The heck were you doing there?

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:36.470
You did great, Moe-<i>chan.</i>

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:42.270
Now then. Moe-<i>chan</i> is a
professional wrestler now.

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:44.770
What's next is to find
your debut match up, but...

00:15:44.980 --> 00:15:47.780
Oooh! I want to fight
against Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:49.030
What?!

00:15:49.240 --> 00:15:51.450
I want Sakura-<i>sempai</i>

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:53.950
to get a firsthand look
of how strong I've become!

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:55.330
Okay.

00:15:55.540 --> 00:15:59.960
If that's what you want,
I'll face you in your debut match.

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:05.170
Yay! Now that's my
favorite Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:16:05.380 --> 00:16:06.550
H-Hey, Moe-<i>chan</i>...!

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:08.760
- Likey, likey, likey!
- Stop it! That tickles...!

00:16:08.970 --> 00:16:12.430
Oh? So, acting like a
pro against the rookie?

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:15.510
You've got some nerve there, Sakura.

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:21.020
You better not be forgetting
about our match before her debut.

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:25.520
Of course! Let's make
it the best match ever!

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:31.070
We're even right now.
About time I show you who the boss is.

00:16:31.280 --> 00:16:33.870
Yes. I won't lose either!

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:39.000
Hagiwara versus Kazama...
Finally, their third match!

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:41.830
Berserk was really holding it back there.

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:44.380
Now that they settled their differences

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:48.460
I guess we'll be seeing a normal match.

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:51.340
They both have one win and one loss.

00:16:51.550 --> 00:16:54.550
So whoever wins today is the real deal.

00:16:54.760 --> 00:16:57.260
Man, I can't wait!

00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:43.350
Rio-<i>sama</i>!

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:11.340
Today's main event...

00:18:11.550 --> 00:18:15.380
Kazama Rio versus
Hagiwara Sakura will begin shortly.

00:18:15.590 --> 00:18:19.260
Commemorative flowers
will be given before the match.

00:18:19.970 --> 00:18:22.600
Sakura-<i>sempai</i> is so cool!

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:24.230
Hm?

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:29.020
H-Huh? What? What's going on...?!

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:36.530
Sakura!

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:40.580
The hell?! Dammit!
What'd ya think you're doing!

00:18:40.780 --> 00:18:43.160
I'm the one facing Sakura!

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:48.290
Please stop...!

00:18:50.420 --> 00:18:52.300
That Sleeper Hold...

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:54.840
Juri?

00:19:10.100 --> 00:19:11.480
Rio-<i>san</i>!

00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:13.980
She's supposed to be the ace?

00:19:14.190 --> 00:19:17.820
Berserk wasn't as good as I thought.

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:21.740
Blue Panther!

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:26.450
With what you did now and before...

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:28.870
what are you trying to accomplish?!

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:31.670
I only have one goal.

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:35.210
That's to face you, Hagiwara Sakura!

00:19:35.420 --> 00:19:36.210
What?

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:38.970
How dare a novice
like you stand on the ring...

00:19:39.180 --> 00:19:40.800
You're a disgrace to pro wrestling!

00:19:41.010 --> 00:19:43.720
You're just an eyesore here!

00:19:43.930 --> 00:19:46.270
Wh-What...?!

00:19:46.470 --> 00:19:50.100
Only a true wrestler can
stand in this sacred place.

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:53.110
I can't allow a person like you in here!

00:19:53.310 --> 00:19:54.480
Hagiwara Sakura!

00:19:54.690 --> 00:19:57.280
I challenge you to a
match, and if you lose...

00:19:57.490 --> 00:19:59.320
retire from pro wrestling!

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:01.030
Retire?!

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:11.120
How dare she!

00:20:11.330 --> 00:20:15.500
After what she's done to
Chinatsu-<i>san</i>, and Rio-<i>san...</i>

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:17.670
and after mocking Berserk...

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:21.470
I'm not going to let her get away!

00:20:21.680 --> 00:20:24.800
No, Sakura! Don't accept her challenge!

00:20:26.060 --> 00:20:27.310
Misaki-<i>san</i>?!

00:20:27.520 --> 00:20:31.020
I know how you feel, but she's...

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:33.190
I'm sorry, Misaki-<i>san.</i>

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:34.810
Sakura!

00:20:36.520 --> 00:20:39.190
I'll take on your challenge.

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:44.320
That's what I wanted to hear.

00:20:44.530 --> 00:20:47.240
But, it's under a certain condition.

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:48.330
Oh?

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:51.710
I want this to be a
<i>mascara contra cabellera</i>!

00:20:51.910 --> 00:20:53.250
Blue Panther.

00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:56.340
If you lose, I want
you to take that mask off

00:20:56.540 --> 00:21:00.510
and apologize to
Chinatsu-<i>san</i>, Rio-<i>san</i>... To Berserk!

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:02.260
Hah! Apologize?

00:21:02.470 --> 00:21:05.800
You've ruined our matches!

00:21:06.010 --> 00:21:07.890
This is a demand you need to meet!

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:11.680
Very well. Then I guess the match is set.

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:23.280
This is getting interesting...

00:21:23.490 --> 00:21:26.620
Yes, now that's entertainment!

00:21:26.820 --> 00:21:29.200
Japan's girls' pro wrestling will change.

00:21:29.410 --> 00:21:32.870
What will happen now...

00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:39.750
...is all up to you, Sakura!

00:21:40.210 --> 00:21:42.840
<i>Three, Two, One, and here we go!</i>
<i>Let's shoot for the greatest stage</i>

00:21:43.050 --> 00:21:45.430
<i>Dancing & singing, let's liven things up!</i>

00:21:45.640 --> 00:21:50.260
<i>Together it's a brand new day,</i>
<i>c'mon everyone's cheers are</i>

00:21:50.470 --> 00:21:53.140
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:21:57.560 --> 00:22:02.740
<i>Dreams are our heart's sun</i>

00:22:02.940 --> 00:22:08.370
<i>Let's make them real with our magic</i>

00:22:08.570 --> 00:22:13.830
<i>Fashion, makeup, but inside's a passion</i>

00:22:14.040 --> 00:22:17.880
<i>to a bright future</i>

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:19.000
<i>Step up!!</i>

00:22:19.210 --> 00:22:21.670
<i>The spotlight shines</i>

00:22:21.880 --> 00:22:24.340
<i>Microphone stand, fluttering skirts</i>

00:22:24.550 --> 00:22:31.720
<i>The heart's rhythm, swing</i>
<i>swing, notes dance, it's show time!!</i>

00:22:31.930 --> 00:22:37.850
<i>Watch me be No. 1 someday, your No. 1</i>

00:22:38.060 --> 00:22:39.060
<i>Let's sing (All day long)</i>

00:22:39.270 --> 00:22:40.690
<i>Let's dance (All night long)</i>

00:22:40.900 --> 00:22:48.780
<i>With all my love,</i>
<i>more than being first, your smile</i>

00:22:48.990 --> 00:22:50.410
<i>is what I want to see (Hold me tight)</i>

00:22:50.620 --> 00:22:54.370
<i>Let's make true my dream</i>

00:22:54.580 --> 00:22:55.620
<i>Anytime, do my best</i>

00:22:55.830 --> 00:22:57.160
<i>Do your best and don't give up</i>

00:22:57.370 --> 00:22:59.670
<i>Dancing & singing, as yourself</i>

00:22:59.880 --> 00:23:01.130
<i>If you like it, it's all fine</i>

00:23:01.340 --> 00:23:04.710
<i>The beat in your heart is your answer</i>

00:23:04.920 --> 00:23:07.550
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:34.800
Episode 10: Sakura's Fate!

00:23:10.910 --> 00:23:11.950
Chief!

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:14.750
It's the prospect, Moe-<i>chan</i>'s debut match!

00:23:14.960 --> 00:23:17.170
Her opponent is of course, Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:23:17.380 --> 00:23:19.880
Looks like she's got someone to look after now!

00:23:20.090 --> 00:23:22.130
And up next is the match against

00:23:22.340 --> 00:23:25.380
the mysterious masked wrestler, Blue Panther.

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:28.510
I can't believe it would lead to that...

00:23:28.720 --> 00:23:30.890
But, I have faith!

00:23:31.100 --> 00:23:34.520
Faith that Sakura-<i>chan</i> will answer everyone's calls!

00:23:34.800 --> 00:23:39.810
A request from Sakura:

00:23:34.800 --> 00:23:39.810
There are a lot of pro wrestling moves in "Sekatsuyo,"
but they're dangerous, so please don't try them at home!
